collaborative_practice_agreement_require.quote:
Certified nurse practitioners may:
(1) perform an advanced practice that is beyond the scope of practice of professional registered nursing;
(2) practice independently and make decisions regarding health care needs of the individual, family or community and carry out health regimens, including the prescription and distribution of dangerous drugs and controlled substances

